<h2>The practical takeaway</h2>
<p>
  For routine PDF work — the merging, splitting, compressing, and converting that makes up most everyday use — a browser-based tool with no daily cap removes the specific friction Smallpdf's free tier creates, without asking you to install anything or create an account. Keep a server-based tool bookmarked specifically for the handful of tasks (OCR, Word conversion, advanced redaction) that genuinely need one.
</p>

